               <title>Package/Label Principal Display Panel</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>CAREone<sup>®</sup>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Compare to the active ingredient in Children’s Zyrtec<sup>®</sup>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>SUGAR FREE</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>For Ages 2 Years and Older</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Children’s Allergy Relief</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Cetirizine Hydrochloride Oral Solution 1mg/mL</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Antihistamine</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>dosing cup included</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Bubble Gum Flavored</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>24 hr</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>24-HOUR RELIEF OF:</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>• Sneezing</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>• Runny Nose</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>• Itchy, Watery Eyes</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>• Itchy Throat or Nose</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>• Indoor &amp; Outdoor Allergies</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>• Dye Free</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>• Gluten Free</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>OUR PHARMACISTS RECOMMEND</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>4 FL OZ (118mL)</paragraph>
